# Catalog credentials.
#
# Local sideloading and Steam Frame management work without any of these.
#
# Official builds use the short-lived key exchange:
#   copy this file to .env and fill in the public client id and the build
#   secret from the developer portal (Developer -> FrameCyberDeck -> Build
#   secrets). The app asks https://vrsrc.fyi/api/mirror/app-key for a
#   short-lived mirror key at runtime; the build secret never becomes a
#   download key.
VRSRC_CLIENT_ID=
VRSRC_BUILD_SECRET=
#
# Older builds may still embed a static catalog key:
# VRSRC_API_KEY=
#
# Optional overrides for development:
# FRAME_CYBERDECK_CLIENT_ID=
# FRAME_CYBERDECK_BUILD_SECRET=
# FRAME_CYBERDECK_KEY_URL=
#
# Never commit a real credential.
